module org.kde.kirc
# kIRC QML module.
#
# The C++ side of this module is generated by cxx-qt (IrcBridge, MessageListModel)
# and gets its own generated qmldir/registration when the CMake target is built.
# This file exists so that (a) qmllint/qmlls can resolve the module during
# development, and (b) the ThemeEngine singleton has an explicit `singleton`
# entry. When wiring the build, make sure the generated module registration
# includes `singleton ThemeEngine 1.0 ThemeEngine.qml` (qt_add_qml_module with
# ThemeEngine.qml marked SET as a singleton, or this qmldir kept in the module).
singleton ThemeEngine 1.0 ThemeEngine.qml
ConnectPage 1.0 ConnectPage.qml
ChatPage 1.0 ChatPage.qml
MessageDelegate 1.0 MessageDelegate.qml
SettingsPage 1.0 SettingsPage.qml
